Package: @PACKAGE_ID@
Name: Irisin
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Description: Package manager for Apple TV on RootHide custom firmware
 Irisin on the Apple TV's Home Screen shows an address and a code: open the
 page on a phone or computer on the same network to browse repositories and
 install, update and remove packages, each change confirmed on the TV with
 the remote. An on-demand root daemon installs packages natively and
 registers apps with the system, without dpkg.
